WEBVTT

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:10.070
Uri-tan...

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:13.860
I really don't want to fight you!

00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:16.530
Don't be so soft!

00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:20.740
If you don't defeat me, 
I can't give you my Sol/Lull Seal!

00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:24.770
Fine!

00:00:43.720 --> 00:00:46.610
I've... lost...

00:00:47.270 --> 00:00:48.520
Yep, yep...

00:00:57.210 --> 00:01:00.770
Uri-tan's Sol/Lull Seal is mine!

00:00:59.830 --> 00:01:02.620
<b>Boar</b>

00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:05.500
<i>The battle is over.</i>

00:01:07.860 --> 00:01:09.380
Takeru!

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:13.480
I got Uri-tan's Sol/Lull Seal!

00:01:13.480 --> 00:01:14.740
Congratulations.

00:01:15.630 --> 00:01:18.500
Soon I'll be one of the Eto-shin!

00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:19.450
That's right.

00:01:19.890 --> 00:01:23.490
I'm so amazing! I'm almost there! 
Right, Takeru?

00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:23.960
To think you're strong enough 
to defeat me now...

00:01:23.810 --> 00:01:25.290
Hey, are you listening?

00:01:27.770 --> 00:01:29.180
<i>This is urgent news.</i>

00:01:30.170 --> 00:01:31.830
I-It can't be...

00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:54.670
<b>ETOTAMA</b>

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:17.380
<b>Episode 10: Eternal Pervert</b>

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:18.560
My sweet honey!

00:03:19.320 --> 00:03:20.760
Smell, please!

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:24.290
Let me smell you, Nya-tan!

00:03:24.290 --> 00:03:26.970
Get off me, you Holstein pervert!

00:03:26.970 --> 00:03:29.300
Oh, that's fantastic!

00:03:29.300 --> 00:03:32.060
The more violent your love is, 
the more it excites me!

00:03:32.610 --> 00:03:35.900
Please hurry and accept my love!

00:03:36.190 --> 00:03:37.660
No thanks!

00:03:42.540 --> 00:03:43.410
Pop!

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:44.960
Gotcha!

00:03:46.480 --> 00:03:48.410
Nya-tan, not so hard!

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:52.410
Your pressure is going to crush my chest!

00:03:54.090 --> 00:03:54.990
Rip 'em off!

00:03:55.290 --> 00:03:57.160
Oh, yes!

00:03:57.160 --> 00:03:59.630
How stimulating!

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:04.800
Tea's ready.

00:04:05.420 --> 00:04:06.700
Come on over, Mo-tan.

00:04:06.700 --> 00:04:08.180
I'll be right there!

00:04:09.330 --> 00:04:10.310
Meow!

00:04:13.370 --> 00:04:14.610
This is good!

00:04:14.610 --> 00:04:16.810
This tea comes from Ise, 
which is under my protection.

00:04:16.810 --> 00:04:18.650
Mo-tan always brings gifts

00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:20.960
when she comes here.

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:24.450
Of course I do. You take 
care of my honey for me.

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:28.260
<i>Meow? When did she start feeding him?</i>

00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:31.280
It's kinda late to ask this now,

00:04:31.280 --> 00:04:33.210
but why do you like Nya-tan so much?

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:36.000
At last, the time has 
come to tell the tale!

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:37.500
Quit clinging to me all the time!

00:04:38.360 --> 00:04:39.620
Yes, it was...

00:04:39.620 --> 00:04:41.420
She's started talking.

00:04:42.620 --> 00:04:46.150
One summer day, 
in the middle of a squall...

00:04:52.040 --> 00:04:55.530
I had that wonderful encounter.

00:04:56.900 --> 00:05:00.610
Um, why do you both have 
foam all over your heads?

00:05:00.610 --> 00:05:03.220
Because you shampoo your hair 
on rainy days, of course.

00:05:03.220 --> 00:05:04.110
That's right!

00:05:04.110 --> 00:05:07.240
None of this actually tells 
me what happened...

00:05:07.480 --> 00:05:10.330
Nya-tan proposed to me!

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:10.830
Huh?

00:05:11.230 --> 00:05:12.960
I don't remember at all.

00:05:12.960 --> 00:05:16.200
It was a proposal! For sure!

00:05:16.200 --> 00:05:20.000
The way perverts can fill in mental blanks 
exceeds the comprehension of normal people.

00:05:20.300 --> 00:05:22.260
I don't know what really happened,

00:05:22.260 --> 00:05:24.560
but I think not remembering you proposed

00:05:24.560 --> 00:05:26.480
to someone is pretty cruel.

00:05:26.480 --> 00:05:28.200
It's all right.

00:05:29.190 --> 00:05:32.170
The fact she could say it 
naturally enough to forget about it

00:05:32.170 --> 00:05:35.830
makes me so happy.

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:37.040
Also...

00:05:37.690 --> 00:05:40.940
<b>Tape Player</b>

00:05:37.690 --> 00:05:41.640
I recorded it with this tape player, 
so there's no problem!

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:42.010
What?!

00:05:42.010 --> 00:05:44.150
Wow, she has physical evidence...

00:05:44.440 --> 00:05:45.990
Give me that!

00:05:45.990 --> 00:05:47.120
Okay,

00:05:47.420 --> 00:05:50.530
but only if you'll trade your socks for it.

00:05:51.170 --> 00:05:52.240
What'll it be?

00:05:52.620 --> 00:05:54.010
Grr...

00:05:54.310 --> 00:05:56.540
O-Okay, fine...

00:06:04.250 --> 00:06:08.090
<b>th Sock</b>

00:06:05.690 --> 00:06:08.840
I got my 67th sock from Nya-tan!

00:06:08.840 --> 00:06:10.550
You've gotten a lot...

00:06:10.860 --> 00:06:12.620
Now to destroy the evidence!

00:06:12.620 --> 00:06:13.800
By the way...

00:06:13.800 --> 00:06:15.650
I have infinite copies.

00:06:15.650 --> 00:06:16.710
What?!

00:06:16.710 --> 00:06:18.440
Well, that's what most people would do.

00:06:20.190 --> 00:06:23.890
Tonight I'll have a drink 
with this on the side!

00:06:23.890 --> 00:06:24.650
Wait!

00:06:25.890 --> 00:06:27.400
I'm through waiting.

00:06:27.770 --> 00:06:29.330
This is my dream...

00:06:29.630 --> 00:06:33.530
My dream is to make a bed 
cover from Nya-tan's socks!

00:06:33.530 --> 00:06:35.540
Then I can smell Nya-tan all the time!

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:38.410
Don't talk about dreams 
no one asked to hear!

00:06:38.410 --> 00:06:39.930
See you!

00:06:41.720 --> 00:06:44.110
She's the ultimate pervert.

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:47.590
<b>Making Preparations</b>

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:47.590
<b>We're opening at 12:00. Sorry!</b>

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:47.590
<b>Today's Original Menu: Our Special Curry</b>

00:06:45.580 --> 00:06:47.270
Did ya see that urgent news?

00:06:48.130 --> 00:06:50.930
I never thought it would 
actually be implemented.

00:06:51.430 --> 00:06:53.990
The thirteenth Zodiac Precept...

00:06:54.590 --> 00:06:58.360
Third parties will no longer be permitted 
to intervene in Sol/Lull battles.

00:06:59.100 --> 00:07:01.690
Chu-tan's about to make her move.

00:07:02.140 --> 00:07:04.640
This happened because I butted in...

00:07:04.640 --> 00:07:06.570
You weren't butting in.

00:07:07.020 --> 00:07:09.670
If you hadn't rushed in to save her,

00:07:09.670 --> 00:07:11.360
Nya-tan would've been destroyed.

00:07:11.770 --> 00:07:14.470
But no one can rush in to help her now.

00:07:14.470 --> 00:07:15.620
Indeed.

00:07:15.950 --> 00:07:19.800
At this point, all we can do is 
count on Nya-tan's own strength.

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:24.030
What? Ya don't look convinced.

00:07:24.030 --> 00:07:27.660
Nya-tan's strength now doesn't 
even compare to her strength

00:07:27.660 --> 00:07:30.710
when she fought you at 
Takeru-san's house.

00:07:30.710 --> 00:07:32.810
That's right. She's stronger now.

00:07:33.380 --> 00:07:36.310
Yes, Nya-tan has grown stronger.

00:07:36.310 --> 00:07:39.200
Almost strong enough that I wouldn't 
mind giving her my Sol/Lull Seal.

00:07:39.200 --> 00:07:39.790
Then—

00:07:39.790 --> 00:07:40.640
However...

00:07:41.260 --> 00:07:43.290
What has me a little concerned

00:07:43.290 --> 00:07:45.480
is Nya-tan's amnesia.

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:49.520
I have a feeling that somewhere 
in her lost memories

00:07:49.520 --> 00:07:52.030
lies the key to determining the future.

00:07:52.740 --> 00:07:54.910
And there's Chu-tan's strength, as well.

00:07:55.400 --> 00:07:58.380
It already surpasses 
anything we can imagine.

00:08:01.030 --> 00:08:02.210
She's that strong?

00:08:02.650 --> 00:08:06.590
To make absolutely certain, 
I want to get Nya-tan's memories back.

00:08:08.050 --> 00:08:09.210
All right.

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:18.590
There's really no place like home.

00:08:21.180 --> 00:08:22.830
As thanks for this,

00:08:22.830 --> 00:08:24.800
I'll make my honey a grand dinner

00:08:24.800 --> 00:08:27.610
using produce from my homeland.

00:08:32.430 --> 00:08:33.730
What'd you do that for?!

00:08:33.730 --> 00:08:35.000
There was a mosquito.

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:37.530
Oh! Thank you, Master!

00:08:37.770 --> 00:08:39.540
I guess that isn't enough 
to get her memories back.

00:08:41.180 --> 00:08:43.370
Um, what are you doing?

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:46.710
We're gonna be living here from now on.

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:47.380
What?

00:08:47.640 --> 00:08:49.230
Oh, don't mind us.

00:08:49.230 --> 00:08:52.300
We'll build our own rooms 
with Dora-tan's Sol/Lull.

00:08:52.300 --> 00:08:55.890
Uh, no, the problem isn't 
anything physical like that...

00:08:56.200 --> 00:08:57.800
Ah, the mysteries of feminine appeal.

00:08:58.420 --> 00:09:01.090
Dora-tan and Shima-tan are gonna live here?

00:09:01.090 --> 00:09:01.810
Yes.

00:09:05.060 --> 00:09:06.880
What just happened?!

00:09:10.060 --> 00:09:12.150
I guess there was a mosquito...

00:09:12.150 --> 00:09:13.220
Seriously?

00:09:13.220 --> 00:09:14.490
No way.

00:09:14.870 --> 00:09:17.300
Even my Ryuusen Bashou didn't work?

00:09:17.300 --> 00:09:17.870
Then...

00:09:17.870 --> 00:09:20.240
<b>Sesame Oil</b>

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:20.240
Try this five-gallon can 
of sesame oil next!

00:09:20.750 --> 00:09:23.570
I'm sure the god of sesame 
oil will work a miracle...

00:09:22.170 --> 00:09:23.570
Are you guys...

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:27.080
trying to get Nya-tan's memories back?

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:29.140
And with such classic methods...

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:32.000
Why all of a sudden?

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:35.010
Chu-tan is on the move again.

00:09:36.230 --> 00:09:38.150
To avoid the worst case scenario,

00:09:38.150 --> 00:09:41.300
we thought it would be best to get

00:09:41.300 --> 00:09:44.020
Nya-tan her memories back 
as we protect her.

00:09:45.080 --> 00:09:46.740
<i>Nya-tan's memories...</i>

00:09:48.090 --> 00:09:50.770
<i>Something important might</i>

00:09:50.770 --> 00:09:53.180
<i>really be hidden in her memories.</i>

00:09:53.620 --> 00:09:55.460
Meow...

00:09:55.460 --> 00:09:55.990
Meow?

00:09:57.260 --> 00:09:58.450
It's raining!

00:10:01.990 --> 00:10:07.000
<b>[Zodiac Precepts ~Article 13: "Imperial Report"] 
When a Sol/Lull Seal battle is underway as per 
the specifications in Article 4, "Battle Procedure," 
and Article 5, "Prohibitions," the battlefield will be constructed 
to prohibit any direct intervention by any third party.</b>

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:12.040
<b>[Protected Lands] Japan is divided into twelve areas, 
each ruled by an Eto-shin who serves as a messenger to the gods. 
A "Sol/Lull Road" connects all shrines in Japan, 
allowing instant teleportation between them.</b>

00:10:18.250 --> 00:10:21.720
Garlic, mountain yams, 
broiled eel, and Panax ginseng...

00:10:21.720 --> 00:10:25.240
I ended up only buying things 
that aren't local specialties.

00:10:25.240 --> 00:10:26.140
But with these...

00:10:26.430 --> 00:10:29.270
<b>Nutritional Fortification</b>

00:10:26.430 --> 00:10:29.270
<b>For Boundless Energy</b>

00:10:26.430 --> 00:10:29.270
I'll make my special stamina hotpot!

00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:33.270
<b>Plenty of Collagen!</b>

00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:33.270
And of course, for dessert, we'll have 
night confections with lots of stamina!

00:10:33.570 --> 00:10:36.650
<b>Sleep Deprived!</b>

00:10:33.570 --> 00:10:36.650
And the finisher, of course, will be me!

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:38.630
Oh, yes!

00:10:38.630 --> 00:10:42.630
I'll catch all of Nya-tan's overflowing libido!

00:10:44.130 --> 00:10:45.510
Whoops.

00:10:45.510 --> 00:10:48.660
Here I am writhing around by 
myself again, and in this rain.

00:11:01.090 --> 00:11:02.940
What gentle lights...

00:11:06.020 --> 00:11:07.820
It's raining pretty hard now.

00:11:07.820 --> 00:11:09.670
We can't play outside.

00:11:09.670 --> 00:11:11.040
Yeah.

00:11:22.880 --> 00:11:25.990
I should've known... There's nothing on it.

00:11:41.190 --> 00:11:42.720
Whose graves are those?

00:11:44.610 --> 00:11:48.400
Nya-tan! When did you get back 
from your nomadic journey?

00:11:48.400 --> 00:11:49.690
Just now.

00:11:50.430 --> 00:11:52.600
Water is precious, you know.

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:55.480
Since it's raining, 
I decided to have a bath.

00:11:55.850 --> 00:11:58.150
So, whose graves are those?

00:11:59.760 --> 00:12:01.340
My family's.

00:12:01.340 --> 00:12:04.560
Oh, I heard about that from Chu-tan.

00:12:04.860 --> 00:12:08.010
You join human families and live with them.

00:12:08.720 --> 00:12:12.630
But everyone in my family dies before me.

00:12:12.630 --> 00:12:15.360
Well, human life is limited.

00:12:15.360 --> 00:12:17.720
They can't stay with you forever.

00:12:17.720 --> 00:12:18.960
Understand...

00:12:19.280 --> 00:12:21.420
But... I'm sad.

00:12:21.960 --> 00:12:25.910
I have many happy experiences 
living with them,

00:12:25.910 --> 00:12:28.930
but it's sad when I have to say goodbye.

00:12:29.190 --> 00:12:32.770
But you won't stop living 
with human families?

00:12:32.770 --> 00:12:34.850
I just hope I can make

00:12:34.850 --> 00:12:37.980
a few more humans smile by 
joining their families.

00:12:41.790 --> 00:12:43.570
If you want to make people smile,

00:12:44.010 --> 00:12:46.830
I think you need to smile more yourself.

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:51.200
What?!

00:12:51.520 --> 00:12:53.080
What are you doing?

00:12:54.820 --> 00:12:57.460
I'm gonna wash away your tears 
and put a smile on your face!

00:12:57.460 --> 00:12:59.760
You don't have to do that!

00:12:59.760 --> 00:13:01.100
I'll just get sad again...

00:13:01.100 --> 00:13:03.090
Then I'll be your family, too!

00:13:04.930 --> 00:13:07.010
I won't die, so you don't have to worry.

00:13:07.010 --> 00:13:09.120
I'll always smile with you!

00:13:09.120 --> 00:13:11.300
What do you think? It's a great idea!

00:13:11.600 --> 00:13:13.100
Nya-tan...

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:17.970
Thank you.

00:13:22.380 --> 00:13:23.410
Nya-tan...

00:13:24.470 --> 00:13:26.760
I pray that I can be

00:13:26.760 --> 00:13:29.560
with Nya-tan forever, and...

00:13:29.560 --> 00:13:33.130
That we can be more lovey-dovey and 
have a more medium-rare relationship!

00:13:40.420 --> 00:13:43.630
Where are you planning to go with 
such a mean look on your face?

00:13:44.110 --> 00:13:46.400
I have only one goal.

00:13:46.400 --> 00:13:48.140
To destroy the cat clan.

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:56.950
Out of my way.

00:13:56.950 --> 00:13:58.470
That's not going to happen.

00:13:58.470 --> 00:14:00.270
Then I will destroy you, as well.

00:14:00.270 --> 00:14:02.850
That's not going to happen, either.

00:14:03.700 --> 00:14:05.540
You were defeated by the cat.

00:14:05.540 --> 00:14:07.780
I don't have to listen to 
your frivolous chatter.

00:14:07.780 --> 00:14:11.270
That's right. I lost to Nya-tan.

00:14:11.720 --> 00:14:12.590
But...

00:14:13.240 --> 00:14:15.880
I won't lose to anyone else.

00:14:17.600 --> 00:14:18.710
Very well.

00:14:19.140 --> 00:14:21.230
There's something I want to test, anyway.

00:14:23.300 --> 00:14:24.960
Start the battle!

00:14:25.470 --> 00:14:27.740
Etotama! Sol/Lull Charge!

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:29.230
Etotama! Sol/Lull Charge!

00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:27.260
<b>Rat                                               Ox</b>

00:14:42.510 --> 00:14:45.780
Ox Eto-shin, Mo-tan!

00:14:43.670 --> 00:14:46.080
Rat Eto-shin, Chu-tan!

00:14:54.450 --> 00:14:55.340
Chu-tan...

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:57.790
Why is she fighting Mo-tan?

00:15:00.570 --> 00:15:02.540
Sorry, but...

00:15:02.540 --> 00:15:06.050
I'll be running in top gear 
from the very start, okay?

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:12.550
You'd better take this seriously, 
or you can't blame me for what happens!

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:29.950
I am always serious!

00:15:29.950 --> 00:15:30.570
What?!

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:34.910
<i>Was that...</i>

00:15:41.440 --> 00:15:42.540
Chu-tan...

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:46.020
What... What are you trying to do?

00:15:47.060 --> 00:15:48.530
I told you.

00:15:48.920 --> 00:15:51.120
I'm testing it on you.

00:15:51.120 --> 00:15:52.110
What?

00:15:52.410 --> 00:15:53.320
Secret technique:

00:15:53.720 --> 00:15:56.290
Etotama Kagura Senguu!

00:15:58.070 --> 00:16:00.300
Etotama Kagura Senguu?!

00:16:00.300 --> 00:16:02.060
She can use that technique?

00:16:02.320 --> 00:16:03.520
What is that?

00:16:03.560 --> 00:16:08.570
<b>Kagura Senguu</b>

00:16:03.860 --> 00:16:06.710
Kagura Senguu is a forbidden ritual that

00:16:06.710 --> 00:16:08.570
only the gods can perform.

00:16:09.030 --> 00:16:16.280
<b>Cat</b>

00:16:09.190 --> 00:16:13.190
You could call it our origin, 
the creator and destroyer of Etotama.

00:16:13.490 --> 00:16:15.280
It's the work of the gods.

00:16:15.280 --> 00:16:16.250
The gods?

00:16:16.970 --> 00:16:19.040
It looks like Chu-tan has sublimated a

00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:22.620
godly technique into an Eto-shin technique.

00:16:23.110 --> 00:16:24.930
When did you learn that technique?

00:16:25.310 --> 00:16:27.300
I don't remember.

00:16:27.830 --> 00:16:30.720
But it may have been sixty years ago.

00:16:31.250 --> 00:16:32.650
Sixty years ago?

00:16:32.950 --> 00:16:36.010
You don't mean... 
In your battle with Nya-tan?!

00:16:36.010 --> 00:16:37.680
I had that cat's

00:16:38.050 --> 00:16:40.140
Etotama in my hand...

00:16:38.050 --> 00:16:40.140
<b>Cat</b>

00:16:41.730 --> 00:16:42.760
But...

00:16:43.190 --> 00:16:44.550
I see...

00:16:44.550 --> 00:16:46.240
So that's what happened.

00:16:46.540 --> 00:16:50.220
Nya-tan's Etotama was injured

00:16:50.220 --> 00:16:52.830
by Etotama Kagura Senguu...

00:16:54.160 --> 00:16:57.740
So that's why she only retained 
parts of her memories,

00:16:57.740 --> 00:17:00.200
and ended up with amnesia.

00:17:00.200 --> 00:17:04.030
Why didn't the cat's Etotama break?

00:17:04.030 --> 00:17:05.870
Because of love!

00:17:05.870 --> 00:17:08.210
It was love! Love!

00:17:08.460 --> 00:17:11.380
Are you joking around?!

00:17:11.810 --> 00:17:13.630
I am not joking!

00:17:13.630 --> 00:17:15.880
You just haven't figured it out!

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:17.100
Me?

00:17:17.100 --> 00:17:18.220
That's right!

00:17:18.690 --> 00:17:21.640
You loved Nya-tan, and that's why—

00:17:22.360 --> 00:17:24.390
Don't be ridiculous!

00:17:25.610 --> 00:17:28.230
Love is not ridiculous...

00:17:29.150 --> 00:17:31.190
At all!

00:17:35.920 --> 00:17:38.820
I feel the same way,

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:41.050
so I understand!

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:42.960
Shut up!

00:17:42.960 --> 00:17:44.840
Shut up! Shut up!

00:17:47.510 --> 00:17:50.090
A heart that wants to protect your...

00:17:50.830 --> 00:17:51.880
Beloved Nya-tan!

00:17:53.040 --> 00:17:54.550
Shut up!

00:17:54.790 --> 00:17:55.760
Chu-tan...

00:18:00.590 --> 00:18:02.260
Your love protected

00:18:02.260 --> 00:18:05.820
Nya-tan's Etotama!

00:18:06.510 --> 00:18:07.730
Special attack:

00:18:07.730 --> 00:18:13.030
Mo-tan Special Driver!

00:18:08.810 --> 00:18:11.320
<b>Mo-tan Special Driver</b>

00:18:19.020 --> 00:18:21.750
Remember, Chu-tan.

00:18:22.800 --> 00:18:25.740
And go back to being the old Chu-tan.

00:18:27.840 --> 00:18:29.520
My love...

00:18:30.010 --> 00:18:31.210
Yes!

00:18:32.010 --> 00:18:33.440
My love...

00:18:34.330 --> 00:18:37.130
Got in my way!

00:18:39.270 --> 00:18:40.640
What's happening?!

00:18:47.690 --> 00:18:50.060
<b>Kokushi Tenchuusatsu</b>

00:18:47.730 --> 00:18:50.060
Kokushi Tenchuusatsu!

00:19:21.970 --> 00:19:23.080
Mo-tan...

00:19:23.760 --> 00:19:25.910
I will destroy you!

00:19:26.750 --> 00:19:28.390
Stop, Chu-tan!

00:19:28.390 --> 00:19:31.810
If you destroy Mo-tan, the balance 
of all creation will fall apart!

00:19:32.230 --> 00:19:34.800
<i>If you do that, terrible things will happen</i>

00:19:34.800 --> 00:19:36.980
<i>to this country you're trying to protect!</i>

00:19:37.520 --> 00:19:39.530
I don't care about that.

00:19:41.070 --> 00:19:42.180
Chu-tan...

00:19:43.070 --> 00:19:45.240
Why did you become

00:19:45.910 --> 00:19:48.100
one of the zodiac?

00:19:49.220 --> 00:19:52.960
Destroy all cats.

00:19:52.960 --> 00:19:54.200
Crush them!

00:20:02.170 --> 00:20:04.430
Etotama Kagura Senguu!

00:20:17.560 --> 00:20:18.570
I've got it!

00:20:21.070 --> 00:20:22.970
Now, come to me,

00:20:23.580 --> 00:20:25.910
ox Etotama!

00:20:30.080 --> 00:20:32.410
<b>Ox</b>

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:36.490
Destroy!

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:50.390
I hereby declare!

00:20:50.780 --> 00:20:54.600
The only one who may challenge me to a 
battle is the Eto-musume of the cat clan,

00:20:54.930 --> 00:20:56.430
Nya-tan!

00:21:01.280 --> 00:21:03.070
<i>The battle is over.</i>

00:21:01.280 --> 00:21:05.360
<b>End</b>

00:21:09.400 --> 00:21:10.370
Mo-tan...

00:21:24.190 --> 00:21:26.040
You're still alive?

00:21:26.770 --> 00:21:28.590
You're a stubborn one.

00:21:36.750 --> 00:21:37.650
Really...

00:21:38.250 --> 00:21:41.020
What do you think you're doing?

00:21:47.080 --> 00:21:48.410
What did you...

00:21:49.310 --> 00:21:52.600
What did you do?!

00:22:01.250 --> 00:22:02.990
What happened?

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:47.190
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:36.100 --> 00:23:37.310
Here are the dragon's...

00:23:37.310 --> 00:23:39.260
...and the tiger's fortunes!

00:23:39.260 --> 00:23:40.160
Ready?

00:23:40.160 --> 00:23:42.650
Drink, drink, and drink some more!

00:23:42.650 --> 00:23:44.330
Cheers!

00:23:44.730 --> 00:23:46.380
Are you just a couple of drunkards?!

00:23:47.190 --> 00:23:48.980
Next time: Cat/Rat Shuffle.

00:23:47.190 --> 00:23:50.030
<b>Cat/Rat Shuffle</b>

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:54.020
<b>Goodbye, my love!</b>

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:54.020
<b>Ox</b>

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:54.020
<b>Illustration: Matsui Eriko</b>
